  "title": "How a peptide lab fixed broken experiment completion",
  "summary": "A peptide-focused biotech lab used Scispot to fix broken experiment completion logic so scientists could trust workflow status across proteomics runs and repeated assays. By reshaping protocol usage, adding structured labsheets, and embedding automation, the lab moved from fragmented tools and manual checking to a single, reliable view of what was actually done.",
